<attribute_fields>
<Type>FIRST</Type>
<COMMENTS>Colorado military retirement exemption (2025). Age-based: Under 55 = $15k, 55-64 = $20k, 65+ = $24k. Honors MSRRA and SCRA. Source: MOAA State Report Card, Colorado DOR.</COMMENTS>
